[32m+[m[32msecurity audit logs. Do not use it to protect production systems.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Planned objectives[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Manage device identities and trusted-device enrollment and revocation.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Sign requests with Ed25519 and verify them against registered public keys.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Authorize tasks using explicit allow-lists.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Prevent replayed and expired requests.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Record security decisions in SQLite without logging private key material.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Provide an interactive terminal demonstration and integration-ready[m
[32m+[m[32m  interfaces.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe objectives above describe planned work. Only the Phase 0 features listed[m
[32m+[m[32munder current status are implemented so far.[m
